---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of use" description={`The terms for using ${SITE.name}.`}>
  <article class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="lead">{SITE.name} is a free tool. By using it you agree to these simple terms.</p>

    <h2>Using the tool</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You may use {SITE.name} for personal and commercial work, free of charge.</li>
      <li>Only compress files you have the right to use and change.</li>
      <li>Don’t try to disrupt the site or use it to break the law.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your files</h2>
    <p>
      Files are processed on your device and never uploaded, so we don’t have a copy of them. Always
      keep your originals: compression permanently removes some detail and may change how a file
      looks or sounds.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      The tool is provided “as is”. We work hard to make it reliable, but we can’t guarantee that
      every file will compress, reach a specific size, or be suitable for a particular purpose.
      Check your results before relying on them.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss arising from use of the tool,
      including loss of data. Because your files never leave your device, keeping backups is up to
      you.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms. The version on this page is the one that applies.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
